                                            Purpose and Reason:
                                    
                                    
The Rhode Island Board of Elections hereby adopts rules and regulations relating to early voting conducted pursuant to and in accordance with R. I. General Laws § 17-7-5(c) and §17-20-1 et seq.  This rule is adopted by the Board of Elections to ensure the secure and orderly conduct of Early Voting through the casting of an emergency mail ballot.                                     
                                



                    

                    

                        
